        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers - We Get The Pick Of The Crop.\n\nTAKE AN EXCLUSIVE HUME VIRTUAL TOUR NOW. CLICK BELOW.\n\nPerhaps the finest house ever to come to the market in Aghnaharna.\n\nThis stunning 5 bedroom detached extra spacious home has it all. Magnificent extra spacious and totally private site. Better than showhouse finish and décor. A Rated. Impeccable pristine condition. Quiet Cul De Sac setting. Walk In Wardrobe. Solar Panels. Walking Distance to the top schools in town. Walking distance to the hospital. Adjacent to the Portlaoise Bus Stop. And So Much More.\n\nThe property enjoys an end of cul-de-sac setting on a massive site which is totally private. The property enjoys immense kerb appeal with its impressive double fronted façade, deep set back setting, exceptional off-street parking and large front walled in lawn.\nStep inside and even your highest expectations will be exceeded. The exceptional quality of this home is immediately apparent. A beautifully finished entrance hall sets the tone for the impressive accommodation throughout.\nThe spacious main living room features rich timber flooring, a feature picture window and a handsome feature fireplace. Double doors lead through to the truly massive kitchen dining room\nThe magnificent kitchen/dining room extends to almost 26 feet and features extensive Shaker-style cabinetry, quality worktops, a large breakfast bar and recessed lighting. \nWith a southerly aspect, large picture windows and double doors leading to the magnificent garden, this room is flooded with natural light.\nJust off the kitchen is a superbly appointed utility room with extensive storage and worktop space. The utility room has its own back door. \nThe massive second reception room offers excellent flexibility as a family room, playroom, home office or 5th bedroom.\nA stylish guest WC complete the outstanding ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the same exceptional quality continues across a bright and spacious landing, serving four beautifully presented and generously proportioned bedrooms.\nThe magnificent master bedroom is particularly impressive, featuring rich timber flooring, a striking panelled feature wall, a large walk-in dressing room and a stylish fully tiled ensuite shower room.\nThe remaining bedrooms are finished to an equally high standard, with excellent fitted storage and beautiful light. \nA tastefully appointed, fully tiled family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\nThere is a drop-down ladder to the massive attic which offers additional storage.\nWith Gas heating, solar panels, and a feature insert fireplace, this property enjoys a coveted A Rating.\n\nThink of the finest best prepared and cleanest showhouse you have seen. Now double it, and you will come somewhere near this amazing home.\nTo the rear is a south facing, exceptionally private, not-overlooked garden, beautifully finished with an immaculate lawn, mature screening and an extensive tiled patio beneath a substantial covered pergola?creating a superb outdoor living and entertaining space.\nThoughtfully designed lighting beneath the pergola and throughout the garden creates a wonderful atmosphere after dark. A separate concrete-built shed, finished to complement the house, provides excellent additional storage.\n\n\nAghnaharna is a gem in Portlaoise. A magnificent and prestigious low-density development within walking distance of quality schools, hospital, and town centre.\nNo. 98 sits on a beautiful Cul de sac with no house behind. It overlooks the impressive green area of Mount Stewart. There is a walking path to the 4 primary schools at Summerhill\n\n1gb fibre broadband available.\n\nHume Auctioneers rank this as one of the finest houses to come to the market in recent years and we strongly recommend booking an early viewing appointment.\n\nBER: A3\nBER Number: 111637898"
